### Get all packages
GET http://localhost:5500/api/packages

### Get package by id
GET http://localhost:5500/api/packages/pkg-002

### Create a package
POST http://localhost:5500/api/packages
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Advanced English Conversation",
    "description": "Improve fluency and confidence through practical English conversation.",
    "level": "Advanced",
    "type": "group",
    "duration": 60,
    "price": 10000,
    "maxStudents": 3
}

### Update package
PUT http://localhost:5500/api/packages/pkg-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "price": 15000
}

### Delete package
DELETE http://localhost:5500/api/packages/pkg-001